<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Electrolux on Lehman list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Electrolux on Lehman list.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Electrolux was added to the European strategy &quot;recommended&quot; list at Lehman Brothers, replacing Atlas Copco, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Lehman said Atlas was excluded from the list following a downgrade by its analysts.</p>
<p>By contrast, Electrolux was added to the list as its rating was raised to &quot;outperform&quot; from &quot;underperform,&quot; due to its recent restructuring plan, including an 11 percent cut in staff worldwide, Lehman said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
